# The facet-runtime commit this checkout of Facet Hawkes Assistant is built and
# tested against. Facet owns exact solving and solver routing, and this
# repository imports it as a path dependency at ../facet-runtime, so an older
# runtime is not a slower system -- it is a missing symbol at import time.
#
# This file is the single source of truth. CI reads it, and
# tests/test_runtime_pin.py fails if any document quotes a different commit.
#
# Raise it in the same change that starts depending on something newer. This
# commit is the one that added the `relation` answer form, on which an equation
# carries both of its sides; the tip of that repository may be ahead of it, and
# that is fine -- the pin is a floor, and the test checks the sibling is not
# below it.
